    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d953">

                <pb facs="0747" n="665" xml:id="pg665"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.00/1616.</note>
                <head>[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic">June 9,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I earnestly request <hi rendition="#italic">Yorktown</hi> remain at Corinto two
                    weeks at least, on account of activities of Zelayistas in Costa Rica reported to
                    this Government. Castro Quesada, Costa Rican minister foreign affairs, is said
                    to be aiding them.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Northcott.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
